},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"何偃","kind":"person","person_id":"pbz_pni_tco","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0048","start":48,"end":53,"surface":"桂陽王休範","kind":"person","person_id":"fjv_3dz_w0m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"韜","kind":"person","person_id":"03n_n2r_8rt_***A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"始興王","kind":"person","person_id":"el1_amk_djh","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":94,"last_line":94,"revision_id":1513918,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-ruantao"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p002","unit_id":"xieyue-complete","text":"𤅢年七歲，王彧見而異之，言於宋孝武，孝武召見於稠人廣衆之中，𤅢舉動閑詳，應對合旨，帝甚悅。詔尚公主，值景和敗，事寢。僕射褚淵聞𤅢年少清正不惡，以女結婚，厚爲資送。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":55,"last_line":55,"revision_id":2400356,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"𤅢","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p002:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"王彧","kind":"person","person_id":"1tc_q18_x7v","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-wangyu"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p002:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"之","kind":"pronoun","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"王彧見而異之：之指段首年七歲的𤅢。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"},{"id